@custom
choose-if: custom_coalition_mirv >= 50
on-arrival: {!

Q.fvp_coa -= Q.party_policy_main*2;
Q.gdsu_coa -= Q.party_policy_main*3;
Q.ldp_coa -= Q.party_policy_main*4;

Q.fvp_coa -= Q.liberal_allience*3;
Q.gdsu_coa -= Q.liberal_allience*5;
Q.ldp_coa -= Q.liberal_allience*7;

if(Q.ldp_mirv_coa > 0 && Q.ldp_coa <= 50)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.ldp_coa - 50;}

if(Q.blpm_mirv_coa > 0 && Q.blpm_coa <= 50)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.blpm_coa - 50;}

if(Q.sapd_mirv_coa > 0 && Q.kpm_coa <= 50)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.kpm_coa - 50;}

if(Q.spm_mirv_coa > 0 && Q.spm_coa <= 50)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.spm_coa - 50;}

if(Q.fvp_mirv_coa > 0 && Q.liberal_reconciliation < 8)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.liberal_reconciliation;}

if(Q.gdsu_mirv_coa > 0 && Q.gdsu_coa <= 50)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.gdsu_coa - 50;}

if(Q.gdsu_mirv_coa > 0 && Q.liberal_reconciliation < 14)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.liberal_reconciliation;}

if(Q.ppu_mirv_coa > 0 && Q.ppu_coa <= 50)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.ppu_coa - 50;}

if(Q.ldp_mirv_coa > 0 && Q.sapd_mir_coa > 0)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.ldp_coa; Q.coa_tention += Q.kpm_coa;}

if(Q.ldp_mirv_coa > 0 && Q.liberal_reconciliation < 18)
{Q.failed = 1; Q.coa_tention += Q.liberal_reconciliation;}

!}
go-to: custom_sucess if failed = 0; custom_failed if failed > 1

@custom_sucess
on-arrival: {!

if(Q.ldp_mirv_coa > 0)
{Q.dvp_mirv_gov = 1; Q.old_middle_dvp += 1; Q.dvp_mirv_mod += 5; Q.dvp_relation += 2*Q.ldp_modifier;}

if(Q.ppb_mirv_coa > 0)
{Q.bvp_mirv_gov = 1; Q.minorieties_ppu += 1; Q.ppu_mirv_mod += 5; Q.ppu_relation += 2;}

if(Q.sapd_mirv_coa > 0)
{Q.sapd_mirv_gov = 1; Q.workers_sapd += 1; Q.sapd_mirv_mod += 5; Q.sapd_relation += 2*Q.kpm_modifier}

if(Q.spm_mirv_coa > 0)
{Q.spm_mirv_gov = 1; Q.new_middle_spm += 1; Q.spm_mirv_mod += 5;}

if(Q.fvp_mirv_coa > 0)
{Q.ddp_mirv_gov = 1; Q.new_middle_ddp += 1; Q.ddp_mirv_mod += 5; Q.ddp_relation += 2*Q.fvp_modifer;}

if(Q.gdsu_mirv_coa > 0)
{Q.z_mirv_gov = 1; Q.rural_z += 1; Q.z_mirv_mod += 5; Q.z_relation += 2*Q.gdsu_modifer;}

if(Q.ppu_mirv_coa > 0)
{Q.ppu_mirv_gov = 1; Q.minorieties_ppu += 1; Q.ppu_mirv_mod += 5; Q.ppu_relation += 2;}

if(Q.asum_mirv_coa > 0)
{Q.asum_mirv_gov = 1; Q.peasants_asum += 1; Q.asum_mirv_mod += 5;}

Q.spd_mirv_gov = 1;
Q.workers_spd += 1;
Q.spd_mirv_mod += 5;
Q.mirvieren_gov = 1;

!}

Our Coalition planning succeded and we succesfully entered the goverment! 

@custom_failed
go-to: custom_try if coa_tention <= 15; custom_failed_2 if coa_tention > 15

Talks about this coalition are in progress, yet we still are not sure if the coalition can work. 

[? if kpm_coa <= 50 and kpm_mirv_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #940000;">KPM</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if asum_coa <= 50 and asum_mirv_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #dd5b00;">ASUM</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if spm_coa <= 50 and spm_mirv_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #ff1919;">SPM</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if fvp_coa <= 50 and fvp_mirv_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if gdsu_coa <= 50 and gdsu_mirv_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if ppu_coa <= 50 and ppu_mirv_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #4b9fde;">PPU</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if blpm_coa <= 50 and blpm_mirv_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #00e8ff;">BLPM</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if ldp_coa <= 50 and ldp_mirv_coa >= 1 : <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> could have a problem with this coalition ?]
[? if ldp_mirv_coa > 0 and sapd_mirv_coa > 0 : <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> and <span style="color: #940000;">KPM</span> will never cooperate ?]
[? if fvp_mirv_coa > 0 and liberal_reconciliation < 8 : <span style="color: #ddd500;">FVP</span> will not cooperate with us as we have not reconciliatiatied with them yet. ?]
[? if gdsu_mirv_coa > 0 and liberal_reconciliation < 14 : <span style="color: #48ba48;">GDSU</span> will not cooperate with us as we have not reconciliatiatied with them yet. ?]
[? if ldp_mirv_coa > 0 and liberal_reconciliation < 18 : <span style="color: #caa58b;">[+ dvp_name +]</span> will never cooperate with us ?]

@custom_try

We could try to convince some unwilling partners to maybe try this coalition.

-@bribe: Maybe we can try to pull some contacts and strings to make it work.
-@concede: Concede on most of the major issues and essentaly promice a bit stronger "toleration".
-@coalition: Return to the drawing board. 

@concede
on-arrival: state_corruption += 1; resources -= 2; spd_mirv_mod -= 20; workers_spd -= 2.5; new_middle_spd -= 2; left_dissent += 2; labor_dissent += 2; center_dissent += 2; reformist_dissent += 1; revolutionaries_dissent += 3; agrarnians_dissent += 2;
choose-if: spd_mirv >= 28
unavailable-subtitle: We dont play big enough role in the Caversket to have much to concede from. 
go-to: custom_sucess

We conceded on a many major issues massively watering down our promices, that will shurely cost us some electorate, but we still managed to enter the goverment.

@bribe
on-arrival: state_corruption += 1; resources -= 2; left_dissent += 2; labor_dissent += 2; center_dissent += 2; reformist_dissent += 1; revolutionaries_dissent += 3; agrarnians_dissent += 2;
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
go-to: custom_sucess

After pulling some strings we manged to convice them to make a goverment with us. 


@custom_failed_2

Even though we work our best to make the coalition work, there are some underlying problem that we cannot resolve. 

-@coalition: We must return to the drawing board. 



